# Decon AI — required API keys. Copy this file to ".env" and fill in the values.
# Without these, the app runs in demo/mock mode (template data, no live scraping).

# ── REQUIRED ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Groq — powers every AI write-up (claims extraction, review narrative, strategy
# briefs). Free tier is enough to test with. Get a key: https://console.groq.com
LLM_PROVIDER=groq
GROQ_API_KEY=

# SerpAPI — powers Amazon search + product + review scraping for BOTH modules
# (Product Intelligence and Review Intelligence). Free tier: 100 searches/month.
# Get a key: https://serpapi.com
SERPAPI_KEY=

# ── OPTIONAL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Apify — only used to pull a DEEPER review sample (~100+ reviews instead of the
# ~10-30 SerpAPI gives per product). Not required to run either module.
# Get a key: https://console.apify.com
APIFY_KEY=
